#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.rst:2
msgid "orthogonalize"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:1
msgid "Orthogonalize ``x`` with respect to ``y`` along the specified dimension."
msgstr "指定された次元に沿って、``x`` を ``y`` に対して直交化します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:3
msgid ""
"This function subtracts from ``x`` its orthogonal projection onto ``y``, "
"so that the result is orthogonal to ``y`` along ``dim`` (i.e., their dot "
"product along ``dim`` is zero):"
msgstr ""
"この関数は ``x`` から ``y`` への正射影を差し引くことで、結果が ``dim`` に沿って ``y`` と直交する（すなわち "
"``dim`` に沿った内積が0になる）ようにします:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"x - \\frac{\\langle x, y \\rangle}{\\langle y, y \\rangle} y\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"x - \\frac{\\langle x, y \\rangle}{\\langle y, y \\rangle} y\n"
"\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:10
msgid ""
"This is the elementary step of the Gram-Schmidt process.  In quantitative"
" finance, it is useful for neutralizing a signal against another factor "
"(e.g., removing market exposure from an alpha signal)."
msgstr ""
"これはグラム・シュミット過程の基本ステップです。クオンツファイナンスでは、あるシグナルを別のファクターに対して中立化する（例: "
"アルファシグナルから市場エクスポージャーを除去する）のに有用です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:15
msgid "The tensor to be orthogonalized."
msgstr "直交化するテンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:18
msgid ""
"The tensor with respect to which ``x`` will be orthogonalized. Its shape "
"must be broadcastable to the shape of ``x``."
msgstr "``x`` を直交化する際の基準となるテンソル。その形状は ``x`` の形状にブロードキャスト可能でなければなりません。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:22
msgid ""
"The dimension along which the orthogonalization will be performed.  "
"Default is -1 (the last dimension)."
msgstr "直交化を行う次元。デフォルトは -1（最後の次元）です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "Returns"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:26
msgid ""
"A tensor of the same shape as ``x`` that is orthogonal to ``y`` along the"
" specified dimension."
msgstr "指定された次元に沿って ``y`` と直交する、``x`` と同じ形状のテンソル。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:31
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:33
msgid ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\n"
">>> y = torch.tensor([1.0, 1.0, 1.0])\n"
">>> QF.orthogonalize(x, y)\n"
"tensor([-1.,  0.,  1.])"
msgstr ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\n"
">>> y = torch.tensor([1.0, 1.0, 1.0])\n"
">>> QF.orthogonalize(x, y)\n"
"tensor([-1.,  0.,  1.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:38
msgid ""
">>> # Each row is orthogonalized independently along dim=1.\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0], [3.0, 4.0]])\n"
">>> y = torch.tensor([[1.0, 0.0], [0.0, 1.0]])\n"
">>> QF.orthogonalize(x, y, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([[0., 2.],\n"
"        [3., 0.]])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 各行は dim=1 に沿って独立に直交化されます。\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0], [3.0, 4.0]])\n"
">>> y = torch.tensor([[1.0, 0.0], [0.0, 1.0]])\n"
">>> QF.orthogonalize(x, y, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([[0., 2.],\n"
"        [3., 0.]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:45
msgid ""
"If :attr:`y` is a zero vector along the dimension, the projection "
"involves division by zero and the result is NaN."
msgstr ":attr:`y` が次元に沿ってゼロベクトルの場合、射影の計算でゼロ除算が発生し、結果はNaNになります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:49
msgid ":func:`orthonormalize`: Orthonormalize a set of vectors."
msgstr ":func:`orthonormalize`: ベクトルの集合を正規直交化する関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.orthogonalize.orthogonalize:50
msgid ":func:`project`: Project a tensor with a projection matrix."
msgstr ":func:`project`: 射影行列を用いてテンソルを射影する関数。"

#~ msgid "The orthogonalized tensor."
#~ msgstr "直交化されたテンソル。"

